            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The review of the existing concepts on visceral pain mechanisms and mechanisms of processing nociceptive stimuli on the level of the sensory neurons of superficial segments of the dorsal cornus of the spinal cord was presented. Also the information on ion channels and receptors, which participate in transduction of pain signals are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
